<!-- Mortal Kombat 3 dedicated profile for the shared cabinet-confirmed
     Wolf/DCS source lineage. MK3 retains the proven UMK3 six-button controls
     and 0xFD7D DSW layout, selects the development-528 PIC response, and maps
     the final four 512 KiB U117..U114 parts immediately at gfx 0x1000000.
     ROM data is user-supplied and CRC-checked. -->
